        "id": "AshePassive",
        "name": "Frost Shot",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Ashe's attacks slow their target, causing her to deal increased damage to these targets.<br><br>Ashe's critical strikes deal no bonus damage but apply an empowered slow to the target.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ashe's Attacks and Abilities <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> by (20% ~ 30%) for 2 seconds. Attacks deal (100% + ([[si:scalecrit]]100% Critical Strike Chance)) damage.<br /><br />Ashe's critical strikes deal no extra damage, instead increasing the <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> to (40% ~ 60%) decaying.",
