        "name": "Enchanted Crystal Arrow",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Ashe fires a missile of ice in a straight line. If the arrow collides with an enemy Champion, it deals damage and stuns the Champion, stunning for longer the farther arrow has traveled. In addition, surrounding enemy units take damage and are slowed.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ashe launches a crystal arrow of ice that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span> the first champion hit and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(200/400/600 + ([[si:scaleap]]120% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stun</span> duration increases with distance travelled, up to 3.5 seconds. Surrounding enemies are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by <span>Frost Shot</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Minimum <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stun</span> duration is 1 second.</span>",
